{
  "_comment": "AnimalSounds (kids shell) screenshot capture: 11 distinct real-use activity states (Who says this? rounds, Where does it live? rounds, animal cards, habitat pages, the sound board), each a different animal/round seed/habitat and a cycled theme (lilac / meadow / bedtime). No home menu, sticker book, parent area, gate or reveal popup in any slot. _setup_taps unlocks full_pack (every animal and both games reachable, no banner), mutes the voice for capture and seeds some heard animals. Screens are opened with KIDS.go(screen, params); play seed fixes the round.",
